  unitName: Jack-O' (Omni)
  unitId: 850378
  unitNumber: 8307
  description: According to one theory, Jack-O' is an artificial life form created
    by the Gear Maker who holds the implanted memories of a certain Gear scientist,
    and her sole purpose is that of opposing the Universal Will. However, her condition
    seems to be highly unstable, and therefore requires the use of her mask, as well
    as toffee, to function. Although there are many mysteries surrounding Jack-O',
    including those regarding her origins, her constant eccentric behavior suggests
    that she pays them no mind.
  summonDesc: I have almost no information on him... But for some reason I remember
    a promise we made.
  fusionDesc: Just a little bit more...<br>One final push and I can shut down those
    skirting edges of divinity.
  evoDesc: Wow, it's so pretty! A tomb dedicated to all the "possible" futures. How
    relaxing...
  element: 5
  rarity: 7
